  id: whatthesteelremembers
  displayName: What the Steel Remembers
  description: 'Purified Essence is not for hoarding. Ingrid says a blade that has drunk it remembers every blow it struck: bring your weapon, or anything you wear into the woods, and empower it at the altar.'
  chain: Hands at Home
  journalNotes: 'At the altar choose Empower: a piece of gear in your bag or worn takes a level for Purified Essence, and every level makes it a little better at what it does. Nothing is wasted: the price is shown before you pay. Ingrid has put a little essence by for the first.'
